Revision history for Perl extension RF::LTE::EARFCN.

0.03 2026-11-13
  - Dropped use of Scalar::Util::dualvar instead of undef - API BREAK
  - Dropped FS_TABLE in favor of calculating fs from BAND_TABLE
  - Updated BAND_TABLE from array to array reference
  - Added channel_offset property
  - Dropped band_note2 property - API BREAK
  - Updated fdl and ful calculations to use channel_offset value
  - Added tests
  - Added test cases for Band 24 optional frequency separation

0.02 2026-11-08
  - Added meta merge data for CPAN

0.01 2026-11-03
  - original version; created by h2xs 1.23

